    "fit": "Stream 96 sequences, features and train labels. Same round4 full22 tuple keys, CLASS3_QUANTUM=.65687, modal target jump sign conversion as learn_moves. Keep full per-key counts and purity; independently fit modal per-code spread sampling each seventh row, as learn_spreads. No rows/targets from audit sequences enter fit.",
