      "Fresh fit key supports and modal purities; audit support-weighted low-count and ambiguity rates; supported=at least20 observations and modal purity>=.95 descriptive only",
      "Direct move versus spread-consistent reconstructed clock disagreement; cached-vs-fresh overlapping-key agreement; do not equate high agreement with true quote labels",
      "Event gap quantiles p50/p90/p99/max for proxy and decoded clocks; unweighted counts only, no labels/score weights in audit",
